\ Dogfood: Slice 3 structs. A flat `Vec2` and a nested `Segment`, exercising
\ the generated constructor/getter/setter/destructure words, componentwise
\ arithmetic over fields, nested juxtaposition access, and a functional
\ setter, all through user-defined words.

type: Vec2 x i64 y i64 ;
type: Segment from Vec2 to Vec2 ;

: sub ( Vec2 Vec2 -- Vec2 )
  | a b |
  &a &x @ &b &x @ -
  &a &y @ &b &y @ -
  Vec2 ;

: len2 ( Vec2 -- i64 )
  | v |
  &v &x @ &v &x @ *
  &v &y @ &v &y @ *
  + ;

: span ( Segment -- Vec2 )
  Segment> swap sub ;

: shift-x ( Vec2 i64 -- Vec2 )
  | v dx |
  &v &x @ dx + | newx |
  v &!x newx ! ;

: main ( -- )
  0 0 Vec2 3 4 Vec2 Segment
  span len2 .            \ prints 25
  5 6 Vec2 1 shift-x &x @ swap drop . ;    \ prints 6
